1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,197
Why keep both?

2
00:00:01,197 --> 00:00:08,567
The Calvin cycle needs ATP and NADPH in a ratio of three to two, one point five.

3
00:00:08,567 --> 00:00:12,708
Non-cyclic flow delivers only about one point two eight.

4
00:00:12,708 --> 00:00:15,924
Cyclic flow makes up the ATP shortfall.

5
00:00:15,924 --> 00:00:18,489
That is its real significance.

